  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Elections 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agreement relates to Norwegian support to a joint team of two Civil Society Organisations namely Institute for Democratic Governance (IDEG) and Civic Forum Initiative (CFI) to undertake a number of activities with the objective of &apos;promoting political and security conditions that would enhance peace, integrity, credibility and acceptance of the results of the 2024 Presidential and Parliamentary elections and post elections&apos;.

Since 2008, IDEG-CFI has successfully implemented multi-year projects focused on credible elections and multiparty governance. These projects have significantly built the organizational and institutional capacity necessary for undertaking complex initiatives aimed at reforming the political landscape. IDEG-CFI convened four high-level national meetings in 2012, 2013, 2016 and 2020, resulting in Presidential Peace Pacts that significantly influenced political conduct and electoral peace.</narrative>
  </description>
